<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian military drones have entered Sudan while RSF drones are being launched from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting reciprocal diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. In northern Ethiopia, an RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers and led IG Douglas Kanja to deploy additional police officers and hold security talks after a Kenyan was killed. The conflict has forced over 50,000 Ethiopian refugees to register in Kenya. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOZDJ2MGo2Tl80VHRKREh2d3dOTXZxR2xHc2RPenJVWDY1RUF0X2tnNHRuLTZ4bTd2QXJndi1ubDJmcXZLbUlyZzlEcDJ0SWt5MEd0V18zdWFPS0g5N2lsTU9oTGNzRG5DUHFZX0QxVy1nWWw3b2d6OC1SbzFNbUNqcDY5RjdQYW1uVjdLZHU1b1pJRy1vdS1UdnhoS1lGUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5CVGVJZm1aalQwN2hISm5maXhReGZydjRYdHp3VHB6dklkX3poaDA3aDBEcU5XODZWcXhzVjhvSTg2b2JrbFlkSDM1LTUtd0NFR2dGV2NyYUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9rWUhrcTV0Rkc0TGlsUGN6NGpwZmsxYXF1aXNIQUJGM09QRjZKeWdnZVJfd2F0X21GWEZTVEZrc0NPR09MS2RaQ1JMcVR2NDdpcWIzeUJ6SHdMMThtekE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPVW1JVmVObjhicDUxbnMtdDNfTmdFcnFqWm1icWhnWmhZODlZbnE0cmZzb0YxX2tCbGhnWF83ZWdIVEJGTDk3STZneTVjaXdJcmlYdDRpT3BCbmc4WUNwWnQ4V296Mk9MRS1rWmNCS0pWNERpb1dLQkw2NThTdkdEdm1JVVAtNUNZMDlaeXNCaU5vZG1xVkxkQ3M5SQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPVzUwNHJsQlZ3Y0tnZVdBemtGQUp3aUhQdjY4MkNwSlFsMVhtZnFXZkdBSFFsaGJfN2FmRDVTQVphZWt3MG9nRXRG